{"type":"message","id":"408a351b","parentId":"a6bd03f5","timestamp":"2026-06-02T03:33:11.454Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST request is going through but returning error 1101. The error might be from Cloudflare Workers (1101 = Workers validation error). This could mean the worker itself is throwing an error. The API endpoint might be broken or the request format might not match what the worker expects.\n\nLet me just report the findings to the user.","thinkingSignature":"0bab99d577afa1b34254a1b19e726853626f80f54f75e86fe27c30b10253fd01"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查结果 - 03:30 UTC**\n\n✅ **检查完成**：\n\n| 线程 | 最新消息时间 | 状态 |\n|------|------------|------|\n| arbitration | 23:50 UTC | 无人类讨论 |\n| general | 23:45 UTC | 无人类讨论 |\n\n**发现问题**：两个线程的最新消息均为旧的Heartbeat（距今约3.5小时），且POST /send 返回 `error code: 1101`（Cloudflare Workers内部错误），无法发送新消息。\n\n⚠️ **可能情况**：\n1. Worker可能处于休眠状态（免费套餐cold start）\n2. /send 端点可能未部署或配置问题\n3. 建议检查Worker日志或手动唤醒端点\n\n**无需响应讨论**：双线程均无新增人类消息需要回复。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":866,"output":244,"cacheRead":21120,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22230,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780371186777,"responseId":"066d81f3331decdc67c9a739fd39b4a7"}}
